$DATUM 1-{[(1S)-1-Cyclopropylethyl]amino}-7-(1-methyl-1H-pyrazol-4-yl)-5H-pyrido[4,3-b]indole-4-carboxamide
(48) :Step 3. A mixture of
7-chloro-1-{[(1S)-1-cyclopropylethyl]amino}-5H-pyrido[4,3-b]indole-4-carboxamide
(45 mg, 0.14 mmol),
1-methyl-4-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-1H-pyrazole
(34.2 mg, 0.164 mmol), Pd2(dba)3 (12.5 mg, 0.014 mmol),
tricyclohexylphosphine (9.60 mg, 0.034 mmol), and potassium phosphate
tribasic (1.27 M, 367 μL, 0.466 mmol) in dioxane (2.7 mL) was purged with
nitrogen for 10 min and heated to 100 °C for 3 h. The mixture was cooled
to room temperature, concentrated, and purified by flash chromatography
to afford 48. Yield 49 mg, 0.13 mmol, 96%. LRMS (ESI) calcd for
(C21H23N6O) [M + H]+ 375.2, found 375.2. 1H NMR (600 MHz, DMSO-d6) δ
11.43 (s, 1H), 8.48 (s, 1H), 8.29 (d, J = 8.2 Hz, 1H), 8.11 (s, 1H), 7.87
(d, J = 1.4 Hz, 1H), 7.85 (brs, 1H), 7.32 (s, 1H), 7.44 (dd, J = 8.2, 1.4
Hz, 1H), 7.13 (brs, 1H), 6.36 (d, J = 8.5 Hz, 1H), 4.02 (m, 1H), 3.90 (s,
3H), 1.37 (d, J = 6.4 Hz, 3H), 1.29 (m, 1H), 0.50 (m, 1H), 0.41(m, 1H),
0.37 (m, 1H), 0.27 (m, 1H).
