5.04 mmol), PdCl2(dppf)·CH2Cl2 (51 mg, 63 μmol), KOAc (0.74 g, 7.56 mmol)
and 6 (1.0 g, 0.52 mmol) in dioxane (12 ml) was heated to 80 °C for 16 h.
The reaction was allowed to cool down and the solvent removed. The solid
was thoroughly washed with pentane (50 ml) and extracted with CH2Cl2 (25
ml). The solvent was evaporated and the grey solid washed with ACN (5
ml). The remaining solid was dried under vacuum to afford 3a. Off-white
solid (796 mg, 95%). 1H NMR (CDCl3, 400 MHz, 25 °C): δ=8.67 (dd, 2JH-H=
7.6 Hz, 3JH-H=2.0 Hz, 1H), 8.62 (dd, 2JH-H=8.0 Hz, 3JH-H=1.2 Hz, 1H),
8.38 (dd, 2JH-H=8.0 Hz, 3JH-H=1.2 Hz, 1H), 8.04 (d, 2JH-H=7.2 Hz, 1H),
7.80-7.92 (m, 3H), 7.68 (t, 2JH-H=8.0 Hz, 1H), 6.69 (d, 2JH-H=8.4 Hz,
1H), 3.88 (m, 4H), 3.63 (m, 4H), 1.42 (s, 12H). 13C NMR (CDCl3, 101 MHz,
25 °C): δ=159.12, 156.79, 155.68, 155.41, 154.38, 138.55, 137.54, 135.55,
130.86, 122.69, 121.65, 120.90, 111.31, 107.21, 84.62, 67.00, 45.86,
25.12. 11B NMR (128 MHz, CDCl3, 25 °C): δ=30.0 (br). ESI-MS: 445.244 [M+
H]+ (calc. 445.241).
