$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 4. Synthesis of pyrazoles 6a-g (Table 2)
3-Bromo-5-furan-2-yl-1-(4-methoxyphenyl)-1H-pyrazole (6d): 95% yield,
white solid,. Mp:85-87°C. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ. 3.86 (s, 3H), 5.88
(d, J =3.5 Hz, 1H), 6.31 (dd, J = 1.8 Hz, J = 3.3 Hz, 1H), 6.65 (s, 1H),
6.95 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 2H), 7.31 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 2H), 7.39 (d, J = 1.8 Hz,
1H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3): δ. 55.7, 107.8, 109.5, 111.4, 114.4,
127.1, 127.7, 132.6, 136.8, 143.0, 143.5, 160.1. HRMS (Cl): MH+,
319.0081; calcd. for C14H11BrN2O2 : 319.0082.
